Absent merc oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-06. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Exposes what the absent merc probes set and read around HandleStrategicTurn and HandleTacticalEndTurn: the statics
guiLastTacticalRealTime of Strategic_Turns.cc and gfTimeCompressionOn of Game_Clock.cc, the function static stamp of
HandleTacticalEndTurn's rotting corpse pass (moved to file scope) with a count of the turns run, and the static
HandleDefiniteUnloadingOfWorld(ABOUT_TO_TRASH_WORLD) of StrategicMap.cc; traces every line CharacterDialogue queues
through OracleCharacterDialogueTrace (Oracle.cc, inactive unless a probe sets a trace); marks the smoke tile's start
frame and delay draws of SmokeEffects.cc AddSmokeEffectToTile 4001/4000 in the trace of 0002 (deviation "Cosmetic
draws in explosions"). No behaviour change. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0028.

